WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:55.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.100
"Kiss Or Kill"

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.000
(Episode 10)

00:01:14.319 --> 00:01:15.319
A-ren.

00:01:17.519 --> 00:01:18.560
He never

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.640
considered himself

00:01:20.799 --> 00:01:22.159
our father.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.719
I will avenge her.

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:13.599
A-yan.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.159
Why push me so hard?

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.199
We're family, after all.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:19.960
Whatever you want,

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:21.879
I can give it to you.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.680
I want

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.080
your life.

00:02:27.639 --> 00:02:28.639
Bullshit!

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.520
I raised you!

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.079
You owe everything you have to me!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.680
When you killed my parents back then,

00:02:35.439 --> 00:02:36.999
did you ever think this day would come?

00:02:38.319 --> 00:02:40.000
Your father got in my way.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.680
Your mother saw things she shouldn't have.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.520
In this line of work,

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.240
those who can't be ruthless

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.360
end up dead.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.280
You're too ruthless.

00:02:50.039 --> 00:02:51.198
That's why you never

00:02:51.199 --> 00:02:52.359
treated us like human beings.

00:02:53.879 --> 00:02:55.759
Your lives belong to me.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.360
Otherwise,

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.199
why would I have raised you?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.879
You want to kill me?

00:03:02.039 --> 00:03:03.039
Fine.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.279
Then I'll have all of you

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:07.840
go down with me!

00:03:14.319 --> 00:03:15.319
Fine.

00:03:16.439 --> 00:03:18.000
Letting them die with you

00:03:18.479 --> 00:03:19.479
is better than

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:20.759
them all becoming

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:21.879
criminals like us.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.039
So you know we're criminals.

00:03:26.879 --> 00:03:28.719
Lin Yan, let me tell you,

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.840
there's no turning back.

00:03:31.479 --> 00:03:33.400
Kill that kid next to you,

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.520
and we can still be free,

00:03:36.639 --> 00:03:38.080
living the high life.

00:03:41.919 --> 00:03:43.479
Even if you've committed crimes before,

00:03:43.759 --> 00:03:44.759
in the future,

00:03:45.319 --> 00:03:46.479
I'll atone for them with you.

00:04:02.439 --> 00:04:03.439
Father.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.800
I'm willing to die for you.

00:04:08.599 --> 00:04:10.599
But am I just a tool to you?

00:04:11.479 --> 00:04:12.479
A-ren.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:14.680
You're my good daughter.

00:04:14.879 --> 00:04:16.839
You're my greatest masterpiece.

00:04:21.079 --> 00:04:22.079
I understand.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.000
I will live and die with you.

00:04:37.199 --> 00:04:38.199
Nie Chuan.

00:04:38.519 --> 00:04:39.959
Go find the government forces first.

00:04:40.199 --> 00:04:41.680
Give them our exact coordinates.

00:04:41.959 --> 00:04:42.959
No.

00:04:43.319 --> 00:04:44.480
I want us to be together.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:46.040
I have to kill Lin Cang.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.600
Only if you bring the government
forces here can you save them.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.600
Nie Chuan.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.160
I know

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:56.800
you're one of them.

00:05:14.079 --> 00:05:15.079
Father.

00:05:15.519 --> 00:05:16.160
Didn't you say

00:05:16.161 --> 00:05:17.719
I was your greatest masterpiece?

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:18.720
Yes, yes, yes.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:19.879
Then today,

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.199
let me do one last thing for you.

00:05:22.519 --> 00:05:23.519
Okay.

00:05:26.319 --> 00:05:28.120
Damn it, wait for me!

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:36.360
Okay, okay, okay.

00:05:37.439 --> 00:05:38.439
What are you doing?

00:05:41.879 --> 00:05:43.560
Let go of me right now!

00:05:43.759 --> 00:05:44.519
Or else

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.120
I'll detonate it right now!

00:05:52.066 --> 00:05:53.066
Father!

00:05:55.399 --> 00:05:56.279
A-ren, don't!

00:05:56.399 --> 00:05:57.438
Are you crazy?

00:05:57.439 --> 00:05:58.000
A-ren!

00:05:58.360 --> 00:05:59.720
Get out! Get out of here!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.319
Hurry up and leave!

00:06:02.639 --> 00:06:03.079
Father.

00:06:03.279 --> 00:06:04.279
In the next life,

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:06.319
don't adopt me again.

00:06:07.199 --> 00:06:08.199
No!

00:06:20.199 --> 00:06:21.247
Lin Yan!

00:06:21.271 --> 00:06:22.319
Run!

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:23.839
Lin Yan!

00:06:45.639 --> 00:06:47.439
Lin Yan!

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:54.800
Lin Yan!

00:08:09.475 --> 00:08:11.022
(Lin Criminals)

00:08:11.209 --> 00:08:13.489
(A-Ren)

00:08:15.462 --> 00:08:16.835
(Lin Cang)

00:08:18.082 --> 00:08:20.415
(Lin Yan)

00:08:23.279 --> 00:08:24.279
He's not...!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.439
He really isn't.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.000
Just like you,

00:08:32.399 --> 00:08:33.519
he works for the government.

00:08:46.888 --> 00:08:49.348
(Lin Yang)

00:08:50.875 --> 00:08:51.802
(Three years ago)

00:08:51.919 --> 00:08:52.960
Six years ago,

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.080
Lin Yan approached the government forces

00:08:55.279 --> 00:08:56.519
and requested to go undercover.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:58.918
He also changed his name in the system

00:08:58.919 --> 00:09:00.039
to Lin Yang.

00:09:02.639 --> 00:09:04.359
Three years ago, his handler was in danger.

00:09:04.799 --> 00:09:06.479
His rescue mission in the war zone failed,

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.279
so he was transferred to me.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.200
My name is Lin Yang.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.096
I joined the government
forces three years ago.

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:16.360
I've read your file.

00:09:16.799 --> 00:09:17.799
Your handler is dead.

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:19.160
From now on, you report to me.

00:09:20.399 --> 00:09:21.440
Yes, sir.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.120
For your upcoming mission,

00:09:23.519 --> 00:09:25.519
you'll have to betray the
family you grew up with.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.600
Can you do that?

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:29.919
It was never a family.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.240
It was hell.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.760
The mission is highly dangerous.

00:09:34.559 --> 00:09:37.120
I'm ready to sacrifice myself at any time??

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:40.960
For the light.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.240
So,

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.600
your name is Lin Yang.

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:54.600
A-yang.

00:10:05.679 --> 00:10:06.679
What's your name?

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:09.480
Just call me A-yang.

00:10:11.759 --> 00:10:13.159
Doesn't sound like a real name.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.919
So you didn't lie to me.

00:10:19.879 --> 00:10:20.879
You didn't lie.

00:10:25.799 --> 00:10:27.240
You never lied to me.

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:29.760
I was the one who didn't trust you.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.720
Are you disinfecting this or torturing me?

00:11:41.159 --> 00:11:42.399
Then hold still.

00:11:42.759 --> 00:11:43.759
I'll see how you behave.

00:12:08.279 --> 00:12:09.279
You're back.

00:12:12.279 --> 00:12:13.799
You really make yourself at home, huh?

00:12:14.073 --> 00:12:15.112
The perks are nice.

00:12:15.645 --> 00:12:16.645
I'm very satisfied.

00:12:17.679 --> 00:12:18.999
Hurry up and put your clothes on.

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.280
I can only wait for you
to issue me a uniform.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.720
Then I'll just wear whatever's available.

00:12:33.919 --> 00:12:34.919
Eat up.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.000
How is it?

00:12:36.039 --> 00:12:37.039
Not bad, right?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.200
Nie Chuan.

00:12:42.799 --> 00:12:43.799
It's pretty good.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.320
What else do you want to eat?

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:46.880
You can order whatever you want.

00:13:05.919 --> 00:13:06.919
Feed me.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.000
As long as you're not
afraid I'll poison you.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.240
For a first attempt,

00:13:16.919 --> 00:13:17.919
it tastes pretty good.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.360
Even food can't shut you up.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:28.440
You knew.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.159
I knew.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.360
You knew, yet you still
trusted him so much?

00:13:34.399 --> 00:13:35.439
He's the only one I trust.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.799
Lin Yan was trained by Lin Cang
from a young age to be an arms dealer.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.480
Six years ago,

00:14:26.639 --> 00:14:28.679
Lin Cang committed the
Luoman Village massacre.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:32.495
Lin Yan saw with his own eyes the elderly and
children who moved goods for them get blown up.

00:14:32.519 --> 00:14:34.720
He finally saw the true
evil of the Lin family.

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:37.120
So he turned to the government forces

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.000
and carried out a six-year
undercover mission

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.720
just to bring Lin Cang and his kind

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.399
to justice.

00:14:45.639 --> 00:14:46.720
I go over it every day.

00:14:47.879 --> 00:14:48.879
Six years ago,

00:14:49.759 --> 00:14:51.079
the incident at Luoman Village...

00:14:56.279 --> 00:14:57.200
I always thought

00:14:57.201 --> 00:14:58.761
it was a command error by my superiors.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.679
But later I found out

00:15:02.046 --> 00:15:05.402
that those arms dealers would even exploit
the elderly and children in the village.

00:15:09.799 --> 00:15:11.720
Some debts can never be settled.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:14.320
These hands

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.280
shouldn't be doing these things.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.679
Smuggling guns, running
goods, spilling blood...

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.360
It doesn't suit them.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.399
You care too much.

00:15:42.919 --> 00:15:44.000
Three years ago,

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.799
if I had known you were worth this much,

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.720
I wouldn't have just stolen a ring.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.360
I sometimes wonder

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.919
what it would be like if I saw you again.

00:15:57.960 --> 00:15:59.159
Now that you have,

00:16:00.279 --> 00:16:02.239
- ...it's totally-
- different from how I imagined.

00:16:07.879 --> 00:16:09.519
I imagined the many ways we'd meet again.

00:16:10.399 --> 00:16:11.360
On the street,

00:16:11.361 --> 00:16:12.799
or even on some battlefield.

00:16:13.399 --> 00:16:15.039
Maybe you'd smile at me.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.600
Maybe...

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.559
maybe I'd save you again.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.440
But I never expected

00:16:23.559 --> 00:16:25.080
you'd be pointing a gun at me.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:33.120
Lin Yan.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.240
In these past three years,

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.679
did you ever think of me?

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.919
That's another life on your hands.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.360
Stay out of this mess.

00:17:02.919 --> 00:17:04.359
We're from two different worlds.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:13.039
We've always been on the same path.

00:17:39.759 --> 00:17:41.319
Why did you keep this from me?

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.519
Once he found out that Lin Cang's
backer was Song Peng,

00:17:59.839 --> 00:18:01.640
he knew he might not make it back.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.640
He didn't want to drag you down with him.

00:18:05.279 --> 00:18:06.679
That's why he pushed you away.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.079
I don't care who's backing him

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.720
or how powerful they are.

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:11.440
If he stands in your way,

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:13.519
I'll make him disappear.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:14.920
But his influence

00:18:15.599 --> 00:18:17.119
is far beyond what we imagined.

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:18.839
Don't underestimate me.

00:18:19.559 --> 00:18:20.559
Chances are,

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.119
I can help you

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.200
way more than you realize.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.359
Were you planning

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:27.839
to go after Lin Cang alone?

00:18:28.079 --> 00:18:29.399
You know Song Peng is protecting him,

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.535
and you didn't want me
getting killed in the crossfire.

00:18:31.559 --> 00:18:32.799
I've seen it all.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.319
You think I'm scared of Song Peng?

00:18:46.039 --> 00:18:47.279
Well, I am.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:10.900
(One year later)

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.758
Wait up! Slow down!

00:19:12.759 --> 00:19:13.759
Come here.

00:19:16.993 --> 00:19:17.993
It's all taken care of.

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.599
This land is yours now.

00:19:26.279 --> 00:19:27.599
Why bother rebuilding this place?

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:29.599
His parents left this place to him.

00:19:30.519 --> 00:19:31.519
He'll come back.